<+>Build:\r\n\r\ndocker build -t updater-image .\r\n\r\n\r\nRun while mounting Dockersocket:\r\n\r\ndocker run --rm -it -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock -p 9090:9090 updater-image\r\n\r\n\r\n(By default, updater.py will pull and start nginx:latest. can change when working properly)\r\n\r\n\r\nSpecifying a Custom Image:\r\nIf you want the updater to pull and start a different image, set the IMAGE_NAME environment variable, meaning replace nginx:latest in this example:\r\n\r\ncurl.exe --% -X PUT -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"registry_url\\\": \\\"docker.io/library\\\", \\\"image_name\\\": \\\"nginx\\\", \\\"tag\\\": \\\"1.26.2\\\"}\" http://localhost:9090/update-image\r\n\r\nAnother container can invoke this updater container simply by running the docker run command above with the appropriate IMAGE_NAME environment variable set.\r\ncurl.exe POST https://localhost:8443/firmware -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"tag\": \"v1.0.1\", \"imageName\": \"firmware-image-1.0.1\", \"url\": \"https://example.com/firmware/v1.0.1\", \"releaseDate\": \"2024-12-20\"}' -k\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl.exe POST -X https://localhost:8443/firmware -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"tag\": \"1.26.2\", \"imageName\": \"nginx\", \"url\": \"docker.io/library\", \"releaseDate\": \"2025-01-15\"}' -k\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl.exe -X POST https://localhost:8443/firmware ` -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" ` -d \"{\\\"tag\\\": \\\"1.26.2\\\", \\\"imageName\\\": \\\"nginx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"docker.io/library\\\", \\\"releaseDate\\\": \\\"2025-01-15\\\"}\" ` -k\r\nPS C:\\Users\\thatg> curl.exe -X POST \"https://localhost:8443/firmware\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"tag\\\": \\\"1.26.2\\\", \\\"imageName\\\": \\\"nginx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"docker.io/library\\\", \\\"releaseDate\\\": \\\"2025-01-15\\\"}\" -k\r\n\r\ncurl.exe -X POST https://localhost:8080/firmware -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d \"{\\\"tag\\\": \\\"1.26.2\\\", \\\"imageName\\\": \\\"nginx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"docker.io/library\\\", \\\"releaseDate\\\": \\\"2025-01-15\\\"}\" -k\r\n\r\ncurl.exe -X POST https://localhost:8443/firmware -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{ \"tag\": \"1.26.2\", \"imageName\": \"nginx\", \"url\": \"docker.io/library\", \"releaseDate\": \"2025-01-10\"}' -k\r\ncurl.exe -X POST https://localhost:8443/firmware -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{ \"tag\": \"1.26.2\", \"imageName\": \"nginx\", \"url\": \"docker.io/library\", \"releaseDate\": \"2025-01-10\"}' -k
